<title>USA: IPO PRICING - Aastrom prices at $7.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING - Aastrom prices at $7.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	  Aastrom Biosciences Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					  $7</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range		 $7 - $8</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			3,000,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		     Cowen &amp; Co</p>
<p>NOTE: The company cut the estimated price range for shares in its initial public offering to $7 to $8 from $8 to $10.</p>
<p>The company also cut the proposed number of shares to be offered for its planned initial public offering to three million shares from 3.25 million shares previously.</p>
</text>
